#HELPS
1 ABANABI CAVE~
Abanabi is an island cave east of Tel Fyr beneath three great Emperor Parasols
where two hidden sorcerers dwell among hostile creatures and flooded passages.
Raw ebony, diamonds and emeralds gleam on walls beside locked chests and urns.
A legendary claymore rests in the deepest guarded chamber.~
